## Requirements

This resource must be used in combination with the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dynatrace.AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`dynatrace.AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-go="`AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-python="`AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dynatrace.AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-java="`dynatrace.AwsConnection`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dynatrace_aws_connection`">`dynatrace.AwsConnection`</span> resource.
