when the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-go="`AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-python="`AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-java="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dynatrace_aws_connection_role_arn`">`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`</span> resource is being created. To mitigate this, we retry the creation of the <span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-go="`AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-python="`AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-java="`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`" pulumi-lang-hcl="`dynatrace_aws_connection_role_arn`">`dynatrace.AwsConnectionRoleArn`</span> resource
